sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Utilisateur
    participant NG as Angular (widget chat)
    participant CC as ChatbotController
    participant CS as ChatbotService
    participant OL as OllamaService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>NG: pose une question
    NG->>CC: POST /api/chatbot {message}
    CC->>CS: repondre(message, user)
    CS->>DB: contexte (role, donnees autorisees)
    CS->>OL: prompt + contexte
    Note over OL: llama3.2:3b (local)
    OL-->>CS: reponse en langage naturel
    CS-->>NG: 200 {reponse}
    NG-->>U: affiche la reponse
